<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Welcome to Christ Life Empowerment Center (CLEC). Join us for worship, prayer, fellowship, and the Word of God.">
  <title>Christ Life Empowerment Center (CLEC)</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f7fb;
      color: #222;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    header {
      background: #073b2a;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      padding: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 27px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    header p {
      color: #f5d77b;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    nav {
      background: #052b20;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 12px 5px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07583c, #0b7650);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 65px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 auto 25px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #f5d77b;
      color: #073b2a;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 45px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    section h2 {
      color: #07583c;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .cards {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 25px auto 0;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #00000012;
      flex: 1 1 240px;
      max-width: 310px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #07583c;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    #contact {
      background: #e8f1ec;
    }

    footer {
      background: #052b20;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 22px 15px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 23px;
      }

      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 5px 7px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <img src="6483.png"
         alt="Christ Life Empowerment Center logo"
         class="logo"
         onerror="this.style.display='none'">

    <h1>Christ Life Empowerment Center</h1>
    <p>(CLEC)</p>
    <p>Transforming Lives Through Christ</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About Us</a>
    <a href="#services">Services</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <h2>Welcome to CLEC!</h2>
      <p>
        A place of faith, prayer, love, and spiritual growth.
        Join us as we discover God's purpose and experience
        the transforming power of Jesus Christ.
      </p>
      <a href="#about" class="button">Discover Our Church</a>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="content">
        <h2>About Us</h2>
        <p>
          Christ Life Empowerment Center (CLEC) is a place
          where people come together to worship God, grow in
          faith, study His Word, and encourage one another
          in the love of Jesus Christ.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our desire is to see lives transformed and people
          empowered to fulfil God's purpose for their lives.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services">
      <h2>Our Church Activities</h2>

      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Worship Service</h3>
          <p>Come together with us to worship and praise God.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Prayer Meetings</h3>
          <p>Join us in prayer as we seek God's presence and direction.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Bible Study</h3>
          <p>Grow spiritually through the study of God's Word.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Fellowship</h3>
          <p>Build meaningful relationships in a loving Christian community.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="content">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>We would love to hear from you!</p>
        <p><strong>Church:</strong> Christ Life Empowerment Center (CLEC)</p>
        <p>For service times, directions, and enquiries, please contact the church leadership.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Christ Life Empowerment Center (CLEC).</p>
    <p>All Rights Reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
